{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-ezk-28-1","title":"Ezekiel 28:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":28,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":28,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 God's judgment upon the prince of Tyrus for his sacrilegious pride. 11 A lamentation of his great glory corrupted by sin. 20 The judgment of Zidon. 24 The restoration of Israel.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-28-2","title":"Ezekiel 28:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":28,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":28,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>the prince.Josephus states, on the authority of Menander, who translated the Phoenician annals into Greek, and Philostratus, that this prince was Ithobal.</p>\n<p>Because. 5,17; 31:10; De 8:14; 2Ch 26:16; Pr 16:18; 18:12; Isa 2:12; Da 5:22 Da 5:23; Hab 2:4; 1Ti 3:6; 1Pe 5:5 I am. 6,9; Ge 3:5; Ac 12:22,23; Re 17:3 I sit. 12-14; Isa 14:13,14; Da 4:30,31; 2Th 2:4 in the midst. Heb. in the heart. 27:3,4,26,27; *marg: yet. 9; Ps 9:20; 72:6,7; Isa 31:3 thou set. 6; 2Th 2:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-28-3","title":"Ezekiel 28:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":28,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":28,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>thou are. Da 1:20; 2:48; 5:11,12; Zec 9:2,3 no secret. 1Ki 4:29-32; 10:3; Job 15:8; Ps 25:14; Da 2:22,27,28,47; 5:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-28-4","title":"Ezekiel 28:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":28,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":28,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>29:3; De 8:17,18; Pr 18:11; 23:4,5; Ec 9:11; Hab 1:16; Zec 9:2-4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-28-5","title":"Ezekiel 28:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":28,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":28,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>thy great wisdom. Heb. the greatness of thy wisdom. Pr 26:12; Isa 5:21; Ro 12:16 and by. 27:12-36; Ps 62:10; Isa 23:3,8; Ho 12:7,8; Zec 9:3; Jas 4:13,14 and thine. 2; 16:49; De 6:11,12; 8:13,14; 2Ch 25:19; 32:23-25; Job 31:24,25 Ps 52:7; 62:10; Pr 11:28; 30:9; Isa 10:8-14; Da 4:30,37; Ho 13:6 Lu 12:16-21; 1Ti 6:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-28-6","title":"Ezekiel 28:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":28,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":28,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Because. 2; Ex 9:17; Job 9:4; 40:9-12; 1Co 10:22; 2Th 2:4; Jas 1:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-28-7","title":"Ezekiel 28:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":28,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":28,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>I will. 26:7-14; Isa 23:8,9; Am 3:6 the terrible. 30:11; 31:12; 32:12; De 28:49,50; Isa 25:3,4; Da 7:7; Hab 1:6-8 defile. 15-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-28-8","title":"Ezekiel 28:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":28,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":28,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>shall bring. 32:18-30; Job 17:16; 33:18,28; Ps 28:1; 30:9; 55:15; 88:4,5; Pr 1:12 Pr 28:17; Isa 38:17 are slain. 27:26,27,34</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-28-9","title":"Ezekiel 28:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":28,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":28,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>say. 2; Da 4:31,32; 5:23-30; Ac 12:22,23 thou shalt. Ps 82:7; Isa 31:3 slayeth. or, woundeth.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-28-10","title":"Ezekiel 28:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":28,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":28,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>the deaths. 31:18; 32:19,21,24-30; 44:7,9; Le 26:41; 1Sa 17:26,36; Jer 6:10 Jer 9:25,26; Joh 8:24; Ac 7:51; Php 3:3 by the. 7; 11:9; Jer 25:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-28-12","title":"Ezekiel 28:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":28,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":28,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>take up. 2; 19:1,14; 26:17; 27:2,32; 32:2,16; 2Ch 35:25; Isa 14:4 Jer 9:17-20 Thou sealest. 2-5; 27:3,4; Ro 15:28; 2Co 1:22 full. Pr 21:30; Isa 10:13; Jer 9:23; Lu 2:40; Ac 6:3; 1Co 1:19,20; 3:19 Col 1:9; 2:3; Jas 3:13-18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-28-13","title":"Ezekiel 28:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":28,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":28,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>in Eden. 31:8,9; 36:35; Ge 2:8; 3:23,24; 13:10; Isa 51:3; Joe 2:3; Re 2:7 every. 27:16,22; Ge 2:11,12; Ex 28:17-20; 39:10-21; Isa 54:11,12; Re 17:4 Re 21:19,20 sardius. or, ruby. beryl. or, chrysolite. emerald. or,chrysoprase. the workmanship. 26:13; Isa 14:11; 23:16; 30:32 thou wast. 15; 21:30</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-28-14","title":"Ezekiel 28:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":28,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":28,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>the anointed. 16; Ex 25:17-20; 30:26; 40:9 and I. Ex 9:16; Ps 75:5-7; Isa 10:6,15; 37:26,27; Da 2:37,38; 4:35 Da 5:18-23; Joh 11:51; Re 9:17 upon. 2,16; 20:40; Isa 14:12-15; 2Th 2:4 stones. 13,17; Re 18:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-28-15","title":"Ezekiel 28:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":28,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":28,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>perfect. 3-6,12; 27:3,4 till iniquity. 17,18; Ge 1:26,27,31; 6:5,6; Pr 14:34; Ec 7:29; Isa 14:12; La 5:16 Ro 7:9; 2Pe 2:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-28-16","title":"Ezekiel 28:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":28,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":28,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>the multitude. 27:12-36; Isa 23:17,18; Ho 12:7; Lu 19:45,46; Joh 2:16; 1Ti 6:9,10 filled. 8:17; Ge 6:11; Am 3:9; Mic 2:2; 6:12; Hab 2:8,17; Zep 1:9 therefore. Ge 3:24; Le 18:24-28; Isa 22:19; 23:9; Mic 2:10; 2Pe 2:4-6; Re 12:9 O covering. 14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-28-17","title":"Ezekiel 28:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":28,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":28,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>heart. 2,5; 16:14,15; 31:10; Pr 11:2; 16:18; Lu 14:11; Jas 4:6 thou hast. Isa 19:11-13; Jer 8:9; Ro 1:22-25; 1Co 1:19-21 I will cast. Job 40:11,12; Ps 73:18; 147:6 I will lay. 16:41; 23:48; 32:10; Isa 14:9-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-28-18","title":"Ezekiel 28:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":28,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":28,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>defiled. 2,13,14,16 by the iniquity. Mr 8:36 therefore. 5:4; Jud 9:15,20; Am 1:9,10,14; 2:2,5; Re 18:8 I will bring. Mal 4:3; 2Pe 2:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-28-19","title":"Ezekiel 28:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":28,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":28,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>they. 27:35,36; Ps 76:12; Isa 14:16-19; Re 18:9,10,15-19 thou shalt. 26:14,21; 27:36; Jer 51:63,64; Re 18:21 a terror. Heb. terrors.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-28-21","title":"Ezekiel 28:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":28,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":28,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>set. 6:2; 25:2; 29:2 Zidon.Tyre was a colony of the Zidonians (see on Isa 23:12;) and consequently Zidon was a more ancient, though a less considerable city than Tyre; and it is probable that it was taken by the Chaldeans soon after the destruction of the latter. It was afterwards burnt to the ground by the inhabitants, to prevent it falling in the hands of Ochus.</p>\n<p>27:8; 32:30; Ge 10:15 Sidon. Isa 23:2-4,12; Jer 25:22; 27:3; 47:4; Joe 3:4-8; Zec 9:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-28-22","title":"Ezekiel 28:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":28,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":28,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>I am against. 5:8; 21:3; 26:3; 29:3,10; 38:3; 39:1-3; Jer 21:13; 50:31; Na 1:6; 2:13 Na 3:5 I will. 25; 39:13; Ex 9:16; 14:4,17; 15:21; Le 10:3; 1Sa 17:45-47 Ps 9:16; 21:12,13; 83:17; Isa 5:15,16; 37:20; Re 19:1,2 shall be. 20:41; 36:23; 38:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-28-23","title":"Ezekiel 28:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":28,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":28,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>I will send. 5:12; 38:22; Jer 15:2 and they shall. 25:7,11,17; 26:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-28-24","title":"Ezekiel 28:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":28,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":28,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>a pricking. Nu 33:55; Jos 23:13; Jud 2:3; Isa 35:9; 55:13; Jer 12:14; Mic 7:4 2Co 12:7; Re 21:4 and they. 23,26; 36:36-38; 39:28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-28-25","title":"Ezekiel 28:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":28,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":28,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>When. 11:17; 20:41; 34:13; 36:24; 37:21; 39:27; Le 26:44,45; De 30:3,4 Ps 106:47; Isa 11:12,13; 27:12,13; Jer 30:18; 31:8-10; 32:37 Ho 1:11; Joe 3:7; Am 9:14,15; Ob 1:17-21; Mic 7:11-14; Zep 3:19,20 be sanctified. 22; 36:23; 38:23; Isa 5:16 then shall. 36:28; 37:25; Jer 23:8; 27:11 to my. Ge 28:13,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-28-26","title":"Ezekiel 28:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":28,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":28,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>and they shall dwell. 34:25-28; 38:8; Le 25:18,19; De 12:10; Jer 23:6-8; 33:16 Ho 2:18; Zec 2:4,5 safety. or, with confidence. 38:11; 1Ki 4:25; Pr 14:26 build. Isa 65:21,22; Jer 29:5,6,28; 31:4,5; 32:15; Am 9:13,14 when I. 24; 25:1-32:32; 35:1-15; Isa 13:1-21:17; Jer 46:1-51:64 Zec 1:15 despise. or, spoil. 39:10; Isa 17:14; 33:1; Jer 30:16; La 1:8; Hab 2:8; Zep 2:8,9 and they. 22,24; 34:31; 36:22,23; Ex 29:46</p>"}]}